<title>USA: TABLE - Chrysler sells $500 mln 100-yr debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Chrysler sells $500 mln 100-yr debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Chrysler Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>Chrysler Corp is the third largest U.S. car company.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHRYSLER CORP</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 7.40 PCT   MATURITY  08/1/2097</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.914  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.406 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +82 BPS    CALLABLE 90 YRS</p>
<p>(( -- U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
